      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "\u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\n\u2502        Anaconda (Full)                  \u2502\n\u2502 \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 Miniconda (Minimal)                 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 Python 3.x                      \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 conda package manager           \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 + NumPy, Pandas, matplotlib, etc.   \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502 (preinstalled in Anaconda)          \u2502 \u2502\n\u2502 \u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518 \u2502\n\u2502 + GUI tools, IDEs                       \u2502\n\u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "# Installing from different channels\n\n# Default channel (usually first)\nconda install numpy\n\n# Explicitly from conda-forge\nconda install -c conda-forge numpy\n\n# From multiple channels (search order matters)\nconda install -c conda-forge -c defaults numpy\n\n# Check which channel a package came from\nconda list\n# Output shows channel info: numpy 1.24.0 py311_0 conda-forge"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "# Recommended workflow\n\n# 1. Create conda environment with core dependencies\nconda create -n myproject python=3.11 pandas numpy scikit-learn -c conda-forge\n\n# 2. Activate environment\nconda activate myproject\n\n# 3. Install additional packages from pip\npip install requests  # PyPI-only package\n\n# 4. Export environment\nconda env export > environment.yml\n\n# 5. Other team member reproduces exactly\nconda env create -f environment.yml"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "~/miniconda3/envs/myproject/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 bin/               # Executables, Python interpreter\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 python\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 pip\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 jupyter\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 lib/              # Python packages and libraries\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 python3.11/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 libopenblas.so  # System libraries\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 liblapack.so\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 include/          # C headers\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 share/            # Documentation, data files\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 etc/              # Configuration files"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "# Start with Miniconda\n# 1. Install Miniconda3 (includes Python + conda)\n\n# 2. Create environment for data science project\nconda create -n ds-project python=3.11 -c conda-forge\n\n# 3. Activate it\nconda activate ds-project\n\n# 4. Install dependencies from multiple sources\nconda install -c conda-forge numpy pandas scikit-learn matplotlib jupyter\n\n# 5. Install PyPI-only package\npip install requests\n\n# 6. Export for team\nconda env export > environment.yml\n\n# Content of environment.yml\nname: ds-project\nchannels:\n  - conda-forge\ndependencies:\n  - python=3.11\n  - numpy\n  - pandas\n  - scikit-learn\n  - matplotlib\n  - jupyter\n  - pip\n  - pip:\n    - requests\n\n# 7. Team member recreates\nconda env create -f environment.yml\nconda activate ds-project\npython -c \"import numpy, pandas, requests; print('All good!')\"\n\n# 8. Clean up unused packages\nconda clean --all"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "# With pip (struggle!)\npip install tensorflow\n# ERROR: tensorflow wheel requires CUDA 11.8, cuDNN 8.6\n# You manually download CUDA, configure paths, etc.\n# On colleague's Mac: completely different process\n# On Windows: another completely different process\n\n# With conda (simple!)\nconda install -c conda-forge tensorflow-gpu::2.13\n# Automatically handles:\n# - CUDA 11.8 installation\n# - cuDNN 8.6 installation  \n# - GPU drivers compatibility check\n# - Works identically on Windows/Mac/Linux\n# Share environment.yml, teammate runs:\nconda env create -f environment.yml\n# Done. Exact same setup."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "# View configuration\nconda config --show\n\n# Add a channel permanently\nconda config --add channels conda-forge\n\n# Set channel priority\nconda config --set channel_priority strict\n\n# View channels\nconda config --show channels\n\n# .condarc file (configuration file)\n# ~/.condarc\nchannels:\n  - conda-forge\n  - defaults\nchannel_priority: strict"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
